+# 设计素材说明
+
+日期：2026-11-10。范围：黑白冷调厨房设计提案。
+
+## 厨房参考
+
+- 文件：`kitchen-reference.png`，1536 × 1024，内置 image_gen / imagegen 技能生成。
+- 用途：A/B/C 三方案共用的厨房材质、光照和空间构图参考，不是产品实际 WebGL 截图。
+- 工具输出已复制到项目中；无外链、CDN 或后端请求。
+- 原始生成文件：`C:/Users/Lenovo/.codex/generated_images/01a1c107-a8ac-7382-9398-02eeff123398/exec-28d1cd6c-2918-4a06-80e8-c311bb71cd83.png`。
+- 生成后未进行图片内容编辑；审查图由浏览器渲染 HTML/CSS 控件并截图。
+
+### 最终提示词（原文）
+
+```text
+Use case: photorealistic-natural.
+Asset type: shared kitchen mood reference for a Chinese household refrigerator application UI design review. This is a scene photograph only, NOT a screen mockup.
+Primary request: a realistic, minimal lived-in contemporary home kitchen with a freestanding four-compartment French-door refrigerator as the clear visual anchor.
+Composition/framing: wide landscape 3:2 architectural interior photograph, straight-on at about counter height, refrigerator near the center taking about 35 percent of the image height? Make the refrigerator tall, taking 75 percent of image height, fully visible from top to floor. Cabinets on both sides, a pale window on the left, a short worktop and black faucet on the right, generous wall context, all within a small normal apartment kitchen. Camera perfectly level, no fisheye.
+Subject: matte white French-door refrigerator, two upper doors with slim dark handles, two lower pull-out drawers, all closed; recessed black door seams, physically convincing hinges and mass. White handleless cabinetry, pale cool gray stone countertop, very light blue-gray tiled backsplash, light cool-gray floor. A small white ceramic bowl with two green vegetables on the counter, one folded gray cloth; otherwise tidy and unstyled.
+Lighting/mood: diffused cool daylight from left, soft natural contact shadows, believable subtle reflections, quiet everyday home atmosphere.
+Color palette: predominantly white and pale cold gray, restrained powder blue in backsplash, black only for seams, slim window frames and faucet. Natural muted green in tiny food details. NO orange, NO cream, NO golden light, NO brown wood, NO saturated colors.
+Materials/textures: realistic matte metal, satin lacquer, quartz stone, ceramic tile, subtle fine material texture, avoid plastic CGI appearance.
+Text: no text, no logo, no watermark, no UI, no people, no collage, no labels. Render as one cohesive high quality architectural photograph.
+```
+
+## 既有资源
+
+- 菜谱图复用 `apps/fridge-app/assets/images/recipe-tomato-eggs.jpg`、`recipe-broccoli.jpg`、`recipe-steamed-eggs.jpg`；不新增授权结论，仍需按项目已有素材待办确认正式使用权。
+- 字体复用 `apps/fridge-app/assets/fonts/XiaoyiUI-Regular.ttf` 和 `XiaoyiUI-Semibold.ttf`；来源与许可见该目录 `provenance.json` 和 `OFL.txt`。
+- 图标是样稿内统一描边的 SVG 控件图形；未使用外部图标库或将图标冒充照片。

