+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="zh-CN">
+<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>小易冰箱 · 三套 UI 设计审查</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="review.css"></head>
+<body class="gallery">
+  <header class="review-header"><a class="wordmark" href="index.html">小易冰箱 <span>XIAOYI FRIDGE</span></a><span class="status">设计提案 / 2026.11.10 / 待选稿</span></header>
+  <main>
+    <section class="gallery-intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">A QUIETER KITCHEN, AN EASIER EVERYDAY.</div><h1>把厨房的日常，<br>留给黑与白。</h1><p>简约的黑白界面，浅冷色的真实厨房。<br>三种空间秩序，同一套可信赖的操作。</p></div><div class="intro-notes"><span>01　比较整体布局与厨房比例</span><span>02　检查手机排版与按钮状态</span><span>03　选择一套方向，或提出组合</span><a class="doc-link" href="总体设计文档.md">阅读总体设计文档 ↗</a></div></section>
+    <section class="scheme-grid" aria-label="三套设计方案">
+      <article class="scheme-card"><a class="scheme-image" href="prototype.html?scheme=a"><img src="screens/a/home.png" alt="A 静白全景桌面首页"><span>A</span></a><div class="scheme-info"><div class="scheme-title"><h2>静白全景</h2><span class="recommended">推荐方向</span></div><p>白色窄导航、全景厨房、右侧今日清单。<br>让冰箱成为日常的视觉中心。</p><div class="swatches" aria-label="配色"><i style="background:#fff"></i><i style="background:#f4f6f7"></i><i style="background:#eaf0f3"></i><i style="background:#171a1d"></i></div><div class="scheme-links"><a class="primary" href="prototype.html?scheme=a">进入交互审查 →</a><a href="review-a.png">查看审查大图 ↗</a></div></div></article>
+      <article class="scheme-card"><a class="scheme-image" href="prototype.html?scheme=b"><img src="screens/b/home.png" alt="B 冷雾工作台桌面首页"><span>B</span></a><div class="scheme-info"><div class="scheme-title"><h2>冷雾工作台</h2></div><p>顶部导航、左右工作区、清楚的食材处理。<br>在厨房与清单之间，找到效率。</p><div class="swatches" aria-label="配色"><i style="background:#fff"></i><i style="background:#edf2f5"></i><i style="background:#e5edf2"></i><i style="background:#171a1d"></i></div><div class="scheme-links"><a class="primary" href="prototype.html?scheme=b">进入交互审查 →</a><a href="review-b.png">查看审查大图 ↗</a></div></div></article>
+      <article class="scheme-card"><a class="scheme-image" href="prototype.html?scheme=c"><img src="screens/c/home.png" alt="C 墨线橱窗桌面首页"><span>C</span></a><div class="scheme-info"><div class="scheme-title"><h2>墨线橱窗</h2></div><p>近黑导航、厨房橱窗、横向清单。<br>用明确的线条，整理每一份新鲜。</p><div class="swatches" aria-label="配色"><i style="background:#fff"></i><i style="background:#f7f8f9"></i><i style="background:#eaf0f3"></i><i style="background:#191d21"></i></div><div class="scheme-links"><a class="primary" href="prototype.html?scheme=c">进入交互审查 →</a><a href="review-c.png">查看审查大图 ↗</a></div></div></article>
+    </section>
+    <section class="review-instructions"><div><h2>审查的不只是颜色。</h2><p>每套可查看冰箱、清单、菜谱、家庭、登录、记录与按钮状态。<br>试试新增食材、空表单校验、关闭草稿和丢弃确认。</p></div><div><p>右上角「审查控制」可以切换只读或模拟保存失败。<br>全部使用演示数据；厨房照片是材质参考，不会开门。</p><a href="prototype.html?scheme=a&page=components">查看完整按钮状态 ↗</a></div></section>
